    <button class="modal-btn" onclick="saveKey()">Save Key</button>
    <p class="modal-note">Get yours at <a href="https://console.anthropic.com" target="_blank">console.anthropic.com</a></p>

    <div class="modal-divider"></div>
    <div class="modal-section-label">Sync Between Devices</div>
    <p>Copy your data to use on another device (phone ↔ browser). Your watchlist, portfolio, and API key are included.</p>
